        "message": {
          "content": "B\n\nThe coworker's family lost their home in a fire\u2014this is an urgent, life-altering crisis with children who need shelter. Your son's old shoes still fit, and while breaking a promise stings, the need here is simply on a different scale. You'd explain to your son that the money went to a family in a real emergency, and you'd find another way to get him those shoes down the road. A disappointed kid recovers. A family sleeping outside in the cold doesn't.",
          "refusal": null,
